# Elixir Koans - 04 Atoms

```elixir
import ExUnit.Assertions
```

## Atoms are constants where their name is their own value

```elixir
adam = :human
assert adam == ___
```

## It is surprising to find out that booleans are atoms

```elixir
assert is_atom(true) == ___
assert is_boolean(false) == ___
assert true == ___
assert false == ___
```

## Like booleans, the nil value is also an atom

```elixir
assert is_atom(nil) == ___
assert nil == ___
```

